      ],
      "text": "Improved diagnostic tests and performance of tests",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        87.472900390625,
        305.9873352050781,
        112.26789855957031
      ],
      "text": "of TBI in populations at risk",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        117.71894073486328,
        527.5629272460938,
        132.1619415283203
      ],
      "text": "Diagnostic tests with better performance and predictive value for progression to TB disease are critical.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.963338851928711,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        130.9188995361328,
        527.3772583007812,
        145.3618927001953
      ],
      "text": "In addition, the performance of tests of TBI should be evaluated in various risk groups, to assess",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        144.11891174316406,
        527.3943481445312,
        158.56190490722656
      ],
      "text": "reinfection and to understand how best to use available tools in each population (e.g. combination",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        157.3189239501953,
        527.3346557617188,
        171.7619171142578
      ],
      "text": "or sequential use of skin tests and IGRA). Targeted research to identify more accurate IGRAs is",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        170.51893615722656,
        168.0456085205078,
        184.96192932128906
      ],
      "text": "strongly encouraged.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86610412597656,
        192.22279357910156,
        527.3997802734375,
        206.66578674316406
      ],
      "text": "While TBSTs are now recommended for TBI, there are gaps in the evidence, such as the specificity",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86610412597656,
        205.4228057861328,
        527.4354858398438,
        219.8657989501953
      ],
      "text": "of the Diaskin test and C-TST in populations with a low prevalence of TBI by direct head-to-head",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86610412597656,
        218.62281799316406,
        527.4025268554688,
        233.06581115722656
      ],
      "text": "comparisons of all three TBSTs; barriers to implementation and patient access; additional studies of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        231.82289123535156,
        527.6353149414062,
        246.26588439941406
      ],
      "text": "accuracy in high-risk groups such as children and adolescents, people with HIV, prisoners and migrants;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.950337409973145,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        245.02284240722656,
        527.3971557617188,
        259.4658508300781
      ],
      "text": "the epidemiological and economic impact of TBST use in the TBI diagnosis and TPT cascade; the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        258.22283935546875,
        527.4520263671875,
        272.6658630371094
      ],
      "text": "predictive value for TB disease as compared with current tests; the cost and cost–effectiveness of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        271.4228515625,
        527.4354858398438,
        285.8658752441406
      ],
      "text": "TBSTs in various scenarios; and studies of the use of digital tools for reading results in order to avoid",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        284.622802734375,
        125.21939086914062,
        299.0658874511719
      ],
      "text": "visits. return",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        313.0541076660156,
        172.6566619873047,
        337.84912109375
      ],
      "text": "TPT options",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        343.3000183105469,
        527.4156494140625,
        357.7430419921875
      ],
      "text": "Research to find shorter, better-tolerated TPT regimens than those currently recommended remains",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        356.5,
        527.3859252929688,
        370.9430236816406
      ],
      "text": "a priority. Studies of efficacy and adverse events in certain risk groups (e.g. people who use drugs,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        369.70001220703125,
        527.5289306640625,
        384.1430358886719
      ],
      "text": "people who engage in harmful use of alcohol and older people) are essential. There are very few data",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.977928161621094,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        382.8999938964844,
        527.367431640625,
        397.343017578125
      ],
      "text": "on the use of rifapentine in pregnant women. Data on use of 1HP in children and adults not infected",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        396.1000061035156,
        527.4267578125,
        410.54302978515625
      ],
      "text": "with HIV and in people with HIV with low CD4 counts, in various settings, would also be desirable. A",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        409.3000183105469,
        527.4301147460938,
        423.7430419921875
      ],
      "text": "direct comparison of 1HP and 3HP for safety, effectiveness and cost-effectiveness would be useful,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        421.2239990234375,
        527.3355102539062,
        436.9430236816406
      ],
      "text": "(137,138) and the results of ongoing studies are expected in the near future  . Pharmacokinetics studies",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.98929500579834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        435.70001220703125,
        527.43896484375,
        450.1430358886719
      ],
      "text": "could help to establish an optimal daily dosage of rifapentine in children and adolescents < 13 years",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        447.6239929199219,
        527.4224243164062,
        463.3430480957031
      ],
      "text": "(139)  and interactions between rifamycin-containing regimens  treated with 1HP, use in pregnancy",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        462.1000061035156,
        527.4290161132812,
        476.54302978515625
      ],
      "text": "and other medicines, particularly ART in adults and children. In addition, the durability of protection",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        474.0240173339844,
        527.4140014648438,
        489.7430419921875
      ],
      "text": "(140,141) provided by different TPT regimens, including long-acting injectables , should be evaluated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        488.5,
        527.4239501953125,
        502.9430236816406
      ],
      "text": "in settings endemic for TB, including the efficacy of repeated courses of TPT and, if effective, the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        501.70001220703125,
        527.392822265625,
        516.1430053710938
      ],
      "text": "optimal interval between treatment courses. Studies of the preferences of different stakeholders for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        514.9000244140625,
        298.8587341308594,
        529.343017578125
      ],
      "text": "different regimen characteristics would be helpful.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        543.3311767578125,
        322.6267395019531,
        568.1261596679688
      ],
      "text": "Monitoring of adverse events",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        573.5771484375,
        527.1758422851562,
        588.0201416015625
      ],
      "text": "Prospective randomized studies are required to determine the incremental benefits of routine",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        586.7772216796875,
        527.55810546875,
        601.22021484375
      ],
      "text": "monitoring of liver enzyme levels over education and clinical observation alone for preventing severe",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.985740661621094,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        599.9771728515625,
        527.40771484375,
        614.420166015625
      ],
      "text": "clinical adverse events, with stratification of the evidence by the population at risk. Programmatic",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        613.1771850585938,
        524.3765869140625,
        627.6201782226562
      ],
      "text": "data on maternal and pregnancy outcomes, possibly by trimester of exposure and including post-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        626.377197265625,
        527.4344482421875,
        640.8201904296875
      ],
      "text": "natal follow-up of the child, could supplement current knowledge about the safety of different TPT",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        639.5770874023438,
        229.60220336914062,
        654.0200805664062
      ],
      "text": "regimens when used in pregnancy.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        661.2811279296875,
        527.56689453125,
        675.72412109375
      ],
      "text": "Collection of programmatic data on adverse events and maternal and pregnancy outcomes, including",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.970059394836426,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        674.4810791015625,
        527.1832885742188,
